      "observed": "The FCC crystal nets connect to FCC1 pins 5 (PE6) and 37 (PE7), rather than its PH0/PH1 oscillator pins. The NAVC crystal nets do not connect to NAVC1; its PH0 and PH1 pins instead connect to C37 and C38.",
      "expected": "Each MCU's 25 MHz HSE crystal should connect to that MCU's HSE input and output pins. The specification identifies an HSE crystal for both MCUs.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"31\") (name \"HSE_IN_FCC\") ... (node (ref \"FCC1\") (pin \"5\") (pinfunction \"PE6\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"33\") (name \"HSE_OUT_FCC\") ... (node (ref \"FCC1\") (pin \"37\") (pinfunction \"PE7\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"32\") (name \"HSE_IN_NAVC\") ... (node (ref \"HSE2\") (pin \"1\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"90\") (name \"Net-(NAVC1-PH0-Pad5)\") ... (node (ref \"C37\") (pin \"1\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "HSE crystal (both MCUs) | ABM8G-25.000MHZ-4Y-T3"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "Neither MCU has the intended external high-speed crystal correctly connected, so the HSE clock source will not operate as intended.",
      "confidence": 0.98
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The netlist shows multiple functional connectivity faults: both MCUs' VDD pins are unconnected, the FCC's VCAP pins are assigned to UART3, and the HSE crystal connections do not reach the intended MCU oscillator pins. These are direct netlist findings and would prevent normal board operation."
}

